    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῑόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῖ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mark with a</i>
